    "alias": "House schedule",
    "description": "House mode (upper hall and rooms without their own schedule): Day at 08:00 (1 h glide), Cosy at 19:00 (1 h glide), Night at 22:30 (30 min glide). On HA start it re-syncs the mode to the clock. Kitchen and living room follow Downstairs schedule; the bedroom follows Bedroom schedule.",
